et_sub_gve_story_story_desc_34","1":"守卫身披重型冰甲伫立。普通的攻击毫无意义，必须瓦解那层坚硬的防御，方可通过。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_33":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_33","1":"遗迹大门紧闭。干涸的机关管道等待着填充，唯有融化的雪水能让齿轮再次咬合。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_32":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_32","1":"躁动的生灵阻挡了去路。原本的秩序已乱，唯有以力破之，方能扫清前行障碍。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_2":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_2","1":"迷域1-2"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_35":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_35","1":"迷域7-5"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_34":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_34","1":"迷域7-4"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_des_33":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_des_33","1":"雪花可以通过身体或子弹来进行拾取"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_title_33":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_title_33","1":"雪花"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_33":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_33","1":"所有玩家到达沉睡雪人位置"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_martial_marriage_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_martial_marriage_name_1","1":"比武招亲"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_33":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_33","1":"迷域7-3"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_9":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_9","1":"攻塔弹队"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_32":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_32","1":"迷域7-2"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_5":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_5","1":"迷域1-5"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_des_31":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_des_31","1":"雪球在地面上滚动会越变越大！每回合的移动距离有限"},"TID_team_target_onestop_name":{"key":"TID_team_target_onestop_name","1":"一条龙"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_title_31":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_title_31","1":"雪球"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_31":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_31","1":"将三个雪球献给雪人"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_31":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_31","1":"道路在悬崖处终结。散落的积雪若能重新聚集，便足以填平沟壑，连接彼岸。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_spring_line_game_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_spring_line_game_target_desc_1","1":"让敌人穿过你和队友拉起的连线完成击杀，同时拾取场中刷新的福桃，获得更高的分数排名吧！\n眷侣进行组队还可获得额外奖励哦~"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_21":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_21","1":"迷域5-1"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_hard_name_3":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_hard_name_3","1":"英雄·围攻鸡舍"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_hard_name_5":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_hard_name_5","1":"英雄·深海试炼"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_javelin_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_javelin_target_desc_1","1":"采用拉线方式进行瞄准发射，双方同步发射子弹，子弹命中不同部位造成伤害不同。\n预览线未计算风力影响，最终落点可能会产生偏差。\n玩家被击败后下一回合重生，每次有玩家被击败时可以重新选择一次武器，优先击败对方三次的玩家获胜。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pvp_2v2_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pvp_2v2_name_1","1":"王者擂台"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_javelin_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_javelin_name_1","1":"冰火战歌"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_30":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_30","1":"沿路走来的森林危机重重，小红帽和弹星人终于走到了外婆家，此时发现原来就是大灰狼造成了森林的变异，还声称自己吃下了狼外婆！为了大家的森林，为了小红帽，为了外婆，击败大灰狼吧！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_29":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_29","1":"小红帽决定不再贪玩，邀请弹星人一同前往探望外婆。跟随小红帽的指引，前方好像就是目的地了，没想到遭遇到了变异狼的伏击！万万没想到变异狼开始进化了，居然学会了掌握魔法藤蔓的力量！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_11":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_11","1":"完成所有地块的染色"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_28":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_28","1":"“小红帽们”沿着大灰狼的指引，一路向前意外发现了真正的小红帽。这个贪玩的小家伙原来是在玩耍的时候被黑暗森林的陷阱困住了，解救这个贪玩又可怜的小家伙吧！它说自己快饿了一天一夜了，想吃蘑菇了呜呜呜。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pvp_alliance_pk_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pvp_alliance_pk_name_1","1":"公会争霸赛"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_11":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_11","1":"危机调查"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_martial_marriage_target_win_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_martial_marriage_target_win_desc_1","1":"击败猪无戒"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_4":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_4","1":"原来时间局长盗走了弹弹联盟的文明圣杯，他手下的研究员正准备将火种放入文明圣杯中，他们究竟有什么企图？"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_sword_fly_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_sword_fly_name_1","1":"轻功大赛"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_27":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_27","1":"原本安宁的魔法森林早就被变异蘑菇覆盖，无数生灵被感染成变异生物，在还没找到外婆前一定要守护好大家的森林！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pirate_island_target_win_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pirate_island_target_win_desc_1","1":"击杀全部首领"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_26":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_26","1":"大灰狼交代了外婆在森林深处，“小红帽们”往森林深处走去，继续寻找外婆的下落！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_title_23":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_title_23","1":"毒蘑菇"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_25":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_25","1":"“小红帽们”来到了外婆家，没想到这里已经被大灰狼占领，击败它问出外婆下落！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_24":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_24","1":"没想到，越是深入森林，“小红帽们”遇到了越多的森林生灵被毒蘑菇感染变异。赶紧在事态失控前，消灭一切变异的生物吧。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_tower_name_8":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_tower_name_8","1":"第8层"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_23":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_23","1":"消灭所有毒蘑菇"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_5":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_5","1":"弹星人终于拦截住了时间局长，这位号称时间之神的时间局长发现了文明圣杯里的秘密是……"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_23":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_23","1":"弹星人向蘑菇守护者告知了小红帽失踪的消息，这才得到了蘑菇守护者的原谅。这时守护者告知了魔法森林的蘑菇出现了奇特的变异，只能拜托弹星人帮忙消灭蘑菇了。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_14":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_14","1":"迷域3-4"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_22":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_22","1":"原本以为是无人看守的野生蘑菇，没想到惊动了蘑菇森林的守护者，蘑菇守护者禁止任何人破坏森林的蘑菇！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_21":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_target_win_desc_21","1":"采到所有白蘑菇"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_21":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_21","1":"贪玩的小红帽偷偷溜出去玩，本该前去探望外婆的任务只能交给弹星人了。弹星人只能假扮成小红帽，替她探望森林深处的外婆，在路上打算拾取蘑菇作为送给外婆的拜访礼物。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_dungeon_main_target_win_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_dungeon_main_target_win_desc_1","1":"击败全部怪物或达成特殊关卡目标"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_3":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_3","1":"迷域1-3"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_star_dig_name_2":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_star_dig_name_2","1":"游园再寻星"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_hard_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_hard_name_1","1":"英雄·蚂蚁巢穴"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_16":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_16","1":"迷域4-1"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pvp_alliance_pk_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pvp_alliance_pk_target_desc_1","1":"开服第7天及单周的周一~周三20:00~20:30，与公会成员组成双人队伍，与其余公会成员匹配对战。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_brawl_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_brawl_target_desc_1","1":"完成自己的任务，阻止其他人完成任务！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_30":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_30","1":"迷域6-5"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_29":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_29","1":"迷域6-4"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_support_rank_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_support_rank_target_desc_1","1":"与支援位队友一起组成3人队伍，对抗敌方的3人队伍；合理运用指挥与支援技能，击败对方！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_morph_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_morph_target_desc_1","1":"变身为弹弹星球经典首领，与3名梦弹手对抗，局势反转！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_28":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_28","1":"迷域6-3"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_27":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_27","1":"迷域6-2"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_26":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_26","1":"迷域6-1"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_martial_marriage_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_martial_marriage_target_desc_1","1":"在猪无戒蓄力蛤蟆功时和队友移动到一起，发动“双剑合璧”对其造成大量伤害"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_tower_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_tower_name_1","1":"第1层"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_sword_fly_target_win_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_sword_fly_target_win_desc_1","1":"最终存活"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_25":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_25","1":"迷域5-5"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_12":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_12","1":"啵啵国王让汽水工赶工期，必须生产许多许多的汽水。可怜的汽水工开始运作榨汁机。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_16":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_16","1":"作为正式汽水工，弹星人第一天上班打卡千万别迟到哦，赶在上班时间之前赶紧冲到打卡门前刷脸上班吧。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_24":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_24","1":"迷域5-4"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_des_32":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_tips_des_32","1":"利用雪球可以击破怪物的冰盾！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_23":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_23","1":"迷域5-3"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_22":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_22","1":"迷域5-2"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_18":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_18","1":"迷域4-3"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_11":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_name_11","1":"迷域3-1"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_star_dig_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_star_dig_name_1","1":"乐园呼噜星"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_spring_line_game_name_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_spring_line_game_name_1","1":"岁岁相牵"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_17":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_17","1":"汽水工厂推出了月度考核，可惜弹星人的橘子啵啵同事们抗议工作严重影响进度，为了达成本月的考核绩效，赶紧解决掉这些叛逆的打工啵吧！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_11":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_11","1":"弹星人来到了啵啵汽水工厂，得知为了修建工厂整个啵啵森林都不复存在，决定潜入汽水工厂一探究竟。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_3":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_3","1":"寻星奇遇"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_13":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_13","1":"啵啵果林濒临枯萎，需要把水果重新还给果林，让果林重现生机。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_20":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_20","1":"尽管成为了啵啵国王的得力下属，弹星人也终于无法忍受啵啵国王的绩效压榨，于是弹星人决定打败啵啵国王，拯救所有的啵啵免受汽水生产之苦。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_18":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_18","1":"弹星人们，要开始认真工作咯！今日的工作指标是装满所有的汽水罐，啵啵国王还等着喝美味的汽水。干劲满满的弹星人，终有一天会晋升为汽水工厂的高层管理。"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_name_5":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_name_5","1":"深海试炼"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_10":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_10","1":"太好了，终于将时间局长围堵在时间门前，时间局长偷走文明的火种原来是想逆转整个弹弹星球。如果他成功了，弹弹星球是不是将就此消失在弹弹宇宙中？！！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_9":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_gve_story_story_desc_9","1":"弹星人又碰上了狂热的时间研究员，他们似乎正在为发动时间传送门而积极准备。趁他们还未察觉，摧毁所有的发动装置，阻止他们的时间逆转计划！"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_tower_name_4":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_tower_name_4","1":"第4层"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_13":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_main_name_13","1":"3v3娱乐赛"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_name_3":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_material_name_3","1":"围攻鸡舍"},"AUTO_GEN_team_target_sub_pve_hard_target_desc_1":{"key":"AUTO_GEN_t